===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|socket}}, {{m|enm|soket}}, from {{der|en|xno|soket||spearhead}}, diminutive of {{der|en|fro|soc||plowshare}}, from {{der|en|VL.|*soccus}}, a word borrowed from {{der|en|cel-gau|-}}, from {{der|en|cel-pro|*sukkos}} (compare modern {{cog|cy|swch||plowshare}}), literally "pig's snout", from {{der|en|ine-pro|*suH-}}.

